  ('sample-03@example.com', 'Lerato Mokoena', 'sample-v2-03-lerato',
   '{"participation_years": "2017-18", "current_location": "Johannesburg, South Africa", "origin_location": "Polokwane, South Africa", "languages": "English, isiZulu, Sesotho", "current_role": "Junior Data Analyst at a public health nonprofit; BSc in Statistics", "project": "We built an app that sends appointment and medication reminders by SMS to patients at rural clinics, since most had basic phones with no data. A nurse at our local clinic helped us set the schedule, and missed appointments dropped when we tested it with 40 patients.", "since_technovation": "I started a pre-med track, then switched to statistics after realizing I preferred working with data. I now analyze clinic data for a public health nonprofit and volunteer as a virtual mentor for Technovation teams in Southern Africa.", "impact": "It showed me I could help solve health problems without being a doctor, which my family found hard to picture at first.", "story_angles": "I switched from medicine to statistics, which many people saw as giving up a safe path. Working in Johannesburg, I also see how much strong data and health work happens outside the usual tech hubs and gets overlooked.", "interests": "Using data to improve rural health care, mentoring girls in Southern Africa, and building local tech communities.", "skills": "Python and R for analysis, building dashboards, and writing grant reports and plain-language summaries for funders.", "story_formats": ["Podcast or audio interview", "Written profile or Q&A feature (newsletter, website, blog)"], "speaking_types": ["Speak as a panelist", "Moderate panels and interviews", "Virtual Events", "In-Person Events"], "topic_familiarity": {"Tech & Society (healthcare, environment, etc.)": "Deeply experienced - I work in this area professionally", "Community Building": "Moderately experienced - I have some professional/project experience", "Regional Tech Ecosystems": "Moderately experienced - I have some professional/project experience", "Career Transit